+**
+**      gckOS Os
+**          Pointer to gckOS object.
+**
+**      gctUINT32 ProcessID
+**          Current process ID.
+**
+**      gckHARDWARE Hardware
+**          Pointer to gckHARDWARE object.
+**
+**  OUTPUT:
+**
+**      gckCONTEXT * Context
