+**
+**  Append a WAIT/LINK command sequence at the specified location in the command
+**  queue.
+**
+**  INPUT:
+**
+**      gckHARDWARE Hardware
+**          Pointer to an gckHARDWARE object.
+**
+**      gctPOINTER Logical
